---
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const email = "hello@focuslab.pk";
---

<PageLayout
	meta={{
		title: "Focus Lab",
		description:
			"Focus Lab is a product-led studio. We design, build, and run our own software — and partner with a small number of teams to do the same.",
		ogImage: "/og-image/home.png",
	}}
>
	<div class="page">
		<div class="page__headline">
			<h6>Focus Lab</h6>
			<h1>We build products.<br /> Then we help you build yours.</h1>
			<p>
				Focus Lab is a product-led studio. We design, build, and run our own software — and partner
				with a small number of teams to do the same.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="page__content content">
			<h2>Product first</h2>
			<p>
				We don't start with a deck. We start with the product. Everything we know about shipping
				comes from owning what we ship.
			</p>
			<ol class="list-spaced">
				<li>
					<strong>Product.</strong> Find the smallest thing worth building, then build it.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Design.</strong> Interfaces that feel obvious, on a system that holds up.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Engineering.</strong> Small teams, short cycles, working software over promises.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Operations.</strong> We stay for support, metrics, and the second year.
				</li>
			</ol>

			<hr class="ornament" />

			<h2>What we take on</h2>
			<p>
				A few partnerships a year, where we can be the product team — not an agency on the side.
			</p>
			<ul class="list-spaced">
				<li>New products, from first sketch to first customer.</li>
				<li>Products that need to ship faster or feel better.</li>
				<li>AI features that have to survive real users, not just demos.</li>
			</ul>

			<hr class="ornament" />

			<h2>Have something in mind?</h2>
			<p>
				Tell us what you're building and what done looks like. We'll reply with a straight answer.
			</p>
			<p>
				<a class="button button--theme" href={`mailto:${email}`}>
					Start a conversation <span>&rarr;</span>
				</a>
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
